  "patthana11.5:0.3": "1-5. Kusalattika-vitakkattikaṃ ",
  "patthana11.5:1.1": "Nakusalaṃ nasavitakkasavicāraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ",
  "patthana11.5:2.1": "",
  "patthana11.5:3.1": "Nakusalaṃ naavitakkavicāramattaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ",
  "patthana11.5:4.1": "",
  "patthana11.5:5.1": "Nakusalaṃ naavitakkaavicāraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ",
